{
  "_comment": [
    "Every NEW Milestone 4 sound event (docs/MILESTONE_4.md sections 9, 13.3, 13.4 and 16.4). Owned by the lead; workers request changes.",
    "Existing, reused sounds are not listed and keep their M1 or M2 audio: the player pistol fires blaster.pistol_fire and the player rifle fires blaster.fire (the spec's blaster.pistol.fire and blaster.rifle.fire).",
    "feature: the recipe module tools/assets/sounds/<feature>.py whose FILES entry renders this id. Until that entry exists,",
    "gen_sounds.py renders a labelled placeholder into <group>/<name>[1..variants] (see gen_sounds.py --m4 --placeholders).",
    "loop: every file is rendered as a seamless loop. stream: written into sounds.json as \"stream\": true (long beds and music).",
    "volume goes into sounds.json when it is not 1.0. variants: the number of placeholder files (default 1).",
    "Run python3 tools/assets/gen_sounds.py --m4 --java after editing, then commit the audio, sounds.json, lang part and ModSounds. tools/check_m4_ids.py checks this list against section 16."
  ],
